MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutoriel_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d1405209915e0e42a30b70f3369f33c, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 15071985664
    m_Localized: YAHAH!<p=5> Stellaman comes to the rescue!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711936
    m_Localized: Do not fret,<p=2> young stellanaut!<p=5> This simulation will teach
      you the basics!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711937
    m_Localized: A true Stellanaut must be in top shape!<p=5> Good grief!<p=5> Your
      stomach is growling!...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711938
    m_Localized: In this state,<p=2> you're defenseless...<p=5> And there's no way
      to destroy the cage holding your friend!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711939
    m_Localized: What is this?<p=5> Star bits have fallen from the heavenly vault!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711940
    m_Localized: These star bits have come at just the right time!<p=5> Collect 10
      of them,<p=2> brave stellanaut!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711941
    m_Localized: Let's go!<p=5> Jump to grab those cosmic treats!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711942
    m_Localized: What on earth is that?<p=5> An enemy wall is blocking our path!<p=5>
      There must be a way to get around it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711943
    m_Localized: Sometimes,<p=2> you have to look at things from a different angle...<p=5>
      Or from a different direction!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711944
    m_Localized: Way to go,<p=2> Stellanaut!<p=5> It looks like you can orbit in
      space!<p=5> That's crucial information!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711945
    m_Localized: Look,<p=2> these star bits have piled up like scoops of ice cream!<p=5>
      You're in for a treat!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711946
    m_Localized: Press and hold E (keyboard) or X (controller) to confirm the scoops
      on your cone and eat them all at once!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711947
    m_Localized: "Bon app\xE9tit!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711948
    m_Localized: Can you feel your cosmic power rising?<p=5> Every ice cream you
      eat will gradually fill your stomach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711949
    m_Localized: Eating 10 scoops of ice cream at once gives you an extra heart!<p=5>
      Don't forget that!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711950
    m_Localized: But be careful!<p=5> When you're eating,<p=2> you can't move.<p=5>
      So pick the right moment!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711951
    m_Localized: Once all the star bits have been collected,<p=5> a new batch appears!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711952
    m_Localized: Good grief!<p=5> It looks like the rumbling of your cosmic stomach
      has attracted a vile creature!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711953
    m_Localized: It seems that various enemies and obstacles may appear as your stomach
      fills up...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711954
    m_Localized: So always be on your guard,<p=2> because anything can happen during
      your adventure!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711955
    m_Localized: Hang in there,<p=2> stellanaut!<p=5> The universe is counting on
      you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027948711956
    m_Localized: Now you're finally full,<p=2> stellanaut!<p=5> Your cosmic powers
      are emerging!<p=5> You're invincible!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027952906240
    m_Localized: Now,<p=2> you can eliminate any threat and even jump indefinitely!<p=5>
      Go free your friend!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027952906241
    m_Localized: GO STELLANAUT!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027952906242
    m_Localized: Space seems distorted at the edges...<p=5> Try going through the
      other side,<p=2> Stellanaut!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12027952906243
    m_Localized: That's almost right,<p=2> but you have to hold down the button a
      little longer to select all the scoops!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
